, "author": {"login": "jlawrie", "id": 323167, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzE2Nw==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/323167?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/jlawrie", "html_url": "https://github.com/jlawrie", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jlawrie/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jlawrie/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jlawrie/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jlawrie/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jlawrie/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jlawrie/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jlawrie/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jlawrie/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jlawrie/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "committer": {"login": "web-flow", "id": 19864447, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow", "html_url": "https://github.com/web-flow", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "c18580380e4c680b1351fca46c113f847cf8c4c5", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/SumoLogic/sumologic-kubernetes-collection/commits/c18580380e4c680b1351fca46c113f847cf8c4c5", "html_url": "https://github.com/SumoLogic/sumologic-kubernetes-collection/commit/c18580380e4c680b1351fca46c113f847cf8c4c5"}]}, {"sha": "39bdc9abe4fa3df0b0c09eb33c5b22ac86664672", "node_id": "C_kwDOCmVUFtoAKDM5YmRjOWFiZTRmYTNkZjBiMGMwOWViMzNjNWIyMmFjODY2NjQ2NzI", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Patrick O'Brien", "email": "poblahblahblah@users.noreply.github.com", "date": "2023-06-13T16:54:26Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2023-06-13T16:54:26Z"}, "message": "Reordering HPA spec.metrics to match HPA ordering (#3078)\n\n* Reordering HPA metrics to match HPA ordering\r\n\r\nThis addresses an issue when using ArgoCD (and maybe other GitOps operators)\r\nwhere Kubernetes reorders the objects under the spec.metrics key thus causing\r\nSync issues with ArgoCD.\r\n\r\nOriginally reported to the ArgoCD project here:\r\nhttps://github.com/argoproj/argo-cd/issues/1079\r\n\r\nOriginally reported to the Kubernetes project here:\r\nhttps://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/74099\r\n\r\nOther projects and companies have also addressed this by simply reordering\r\nthe metrics section:\r\n\r\n* https://github.com/kubernetes/ingress-nginx/pull/10043\r\n* https://github.com/nginxinc/kubernetes-ingress/pull/3773\r\n* https://github.com/grafana/helm-charts/pull/758\r\n* https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-helm-charts/pull/103\r\n* https://github.com/Nextdoor/k8s-charts/pull/102\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Patrick O\u2019Brien <patrick.obrien@thetradedesk.com>\r\n\r\n* add CHANGELOG entry\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Patrick O\u2019Brien <patrick.obrien@thetradedesk.com>", "tree": {"sha": "df71fe157b41a45a2a9f190c17e9cc57a3199241", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/SumoLogic/sumologic-kubernetes-collection/git/trees/df71fe157b41a45a2a9f190c17e9cc57a3199241"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/SumoLogic/sumologic-kubernetes-collection/git/commits/39bdc9abe4fa3df0b0c09eb33c5b22ac86664672", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJkiJ9CCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAACnsIACG5/gTGtvYgH/sZREYdZZKV\nmrEgDouKNEj5Al3rR1WoR2Iw7lJDE/PoCDvHYXrjCos4kmnxhwCxWIKrS7bAC0qI\nd048kr+9uicmWfH5ES0hNj2+2/Yw/R0iat/3Cjr6maErfRldoY8vojgSKhXumHdf\nqrI87XN8Xbeplr/z6n3aIYyyNDaWgEeWeK5H4CcV1XKxOIaIM5JmW2cjtq6PfByb\nwv4kcIcsC7Oo7mQ7suFUIDDECwMqw/xNicEXseW36uDjpq/Gt8MB6nQmR5eFcEaV\nbBrnTVrNAhGxJ9NIAuLdxC+v7rRC8o9Pswvdukxe/HM6Ti4u2ZVa0hEL8yg+GLE=\n=TTyz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree df71fe157b41a45a2a9f190c17e9cc57a3199241\nparent cfa840f7ade1fc592af043b911ee6b738e5dd330\nauthor Patrick O'Brien <poblahblahblah@users.noreply.github.com> 1686675266 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1686675266 +0200\n\nReordering HPA spec.metrics to match HPA ordering (#3078)\n\n* Reordering HPA metrics to match HPA ordering\r\n\r\nThis addresses an issue when using ArgoCD (and maybe other GitOps operators)\r\nwhere Kubernetes reorders the objects under the spec.metrics key thus causing\r\nSync issues with ArgoCD.\r\n\r\nOriginally reported to the ArgoCD project here:\r\nhttps://github.com/argoproj/argo-cd/issues/1079\r\n\r\nOriginally reported to the Kubernetes project here:\r\nhttps://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/74099\r\n\r\nOther projects and companies have also addressed this by simply reordering\r\nthe metrics section:\r\n\r\n* https://github.com/kubernetes/ingress-nginx/pull/10043\r\n* https://github.com/nginxinc/kubernetes-ingress/pull/3773\r\n* https://github.com/grafana/helm-charts/pull/758\r\n* https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-helm-charts/pull/103\r\n* https://github.com/Nextdoor/k8s-charts/pull/102\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Patrick O\u2019Brien <patrick.obrien@thetradedesk.com>\r\n\r\n* add CHANGELOG entry\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: